# MODULE retained source sixteen bit eight cell sequential executor
# PURPOSE bounded integration of checked pointer guest state and six command input output
# INPUT little endian source length then little endian fuel then exactly that many normalized command bytes then guest input
# OUTPUT guest bytes followed by provisional one byte diagnostic status
# SUPPORTED add subtract pointer left pointer right binary output binary input
# PREFLIGHT all source bytes lexically checked before any guest execution
# TAPE eight logical guest cells with left and right boundary detection
# STATUS zero success four left boundary five right boundary six fuel depleted thirteen invalid source
# LIMITATION general square bracket loops unsupported and rejected atomically
# LIMITATION unframed status is diagnostic only and physical host closure is unverified
# LIMITATION sixteen bit source length and sixteen bit fuel representation
# PROVENANCE auxiliary code layout generator outside repository not pure BF process certified
# END header
